div.p:
You will use your own judgement about Mr Fielding.There
                 were four Fielding brothers, all fashionable painters of watercolours: Theodore Henry Adolphus Fielding (1781–1851;
                    DNB); Anthony Vandyke Copley Fielding (1787–1855; DNB); Thales Fielding (1793–1837;
                    DNB) and Newton Smith Fielding (1799–1856; DNB). One of the brothers had been giving lessons to
                 Edith May Southey. But I am sorry to hear that any thing ails your sight. If the weakness continues you had better get some
              advice concerning it while you are in town
